  "title": "Fields of The World: Field Boundaries for Portugal",
  "description": "Agricultural holding plot boundaries with unique identifiers and land use classifications for Portugal, derived from the national Parcel Identification System (SIP/iSIP). Includes plot delimitation and classification data for agricultural land management and subsidy applications.",
