    "text": "## Description\r\n\r\nThis dataset is maintained and updated by The SIP, which aims to identify the boundaries of agricultural holding plots, which are assigned a unique number, as well as the delimitation and classification of land use, allowing applications for Community Aid to be submitted and Control Actions to be carried out.\r\n\r\nActions to be performed in the iSIP application are only permitted to technicians accredited for this purpose.\r\n\r\n- **Source Data Curator:** [Land Occupations \u2013 Parcel Identification System (iSIP) \u2013 IFAP](https://www.ifap.pt/isip/ows/)\r\n- **Source Data Provider:** [SIP - INSTALLMENT IDENTIFICATION SYSTEM](https://www.ifap.pt/portal/sip-informacao-basica)\r\n- **Converted by:** Kerner Lab (ASU)\r\n- **License:** CC-BY-NC-4.0\r\n- **Projection:** EPSG:4326\r\n- **Dataset Validity:** 2021\r\n\r\n\r\n--- \r\n\r\n## Attributes\r\n\r\n| Property                  | Data Type |\r\n| ------------------------- | --------- |\r\n| id                        | string    |\r\n| determination_datetime    | datetime  |\r\n| area                      | float     |\r\n| perimeter                 | float     |\r\n| geometry                  | polygon   |"
  },
